"Will is an A-rank Object Shaper who could feel chaos scratching at the door."
"He hitched a ride on the SAL Submerger boat, then killed Captain Adi and Mr. Belasco aboard."
"He steered the Submerger into Matadero's shield, where it and a Wrightmade bomb exploded."
"Before impact he injected a potion into his own neck and slumped."
"His attack spilled the ancient Submerger's magic, flooding Anesidora's coasts."
